  "details": "I can no longer toggle the microphone mute using the buttons on the VR controller.\n\nIt doesn’t work whether I use the default bindings or custom ones.\n\nIt worked fine in previous versions.\n\nI’ve confirmed that this issue is affecting other users as well, at least with the combination of the Pimax HMD and Index controllers.\n\nHowever, while I can’t toggle it using the controller buttons, clicking the microphone icon in the menu to mute/unmute still works fine.",
